Proposed (NOT deployed, 2026-10-30): frozen-pose check in the SLAM-to-FC bridge
(overrides/FAST-LIO/src/fastlio_mavros_bridge.py, the node that publishes /mavros/vision_pose/pose).

Why: L2 faults 2b/2d (planner/sim/faults/RESULTS.md, note 1). FAST-LIO stuck on its last pose,
republished with fresh stamps, passes every freshness check; the FC's EKF fuses it and the vehicle
flies off (f22: 8.4 m/s, 45 m, ground strikes) or drives off (f24: 2.0 m/s). The planner bridge now
detects it during missions (HOLD "slam_frozen" -> executive QRLAND / stop), but a manual flight has
no planner bridge: the check belongs before the FC too.

What: ~frozen_min_n (5) raw /Odometry poses in a row that repeat (within ~frozen_eps_m 1e-5 m and
~frozen_eps_q 1e-6 per quaternion component) -> stop publishing vision pose AND vision speed, log +
STATUSTEXT "SLAM frozen: vision stopped". The FC then loses vision and its own vision timeout / EKF
failsafe takes over (FS_EKF_ACTION; note RESULTS.md note 2: QuadRover's EKF failsafe in flight is
QRALTHOLD). A pose that moves again resumes publishing; the frozen poses are not fed to the frame
tracker, so the resume looks like a gap and re-anchors onto the EKF (enable_reanchor), as after a
laserMapping restart.
Evidence: a real FAST-LIO pose never repeats (4 recordings, ~9200 consecutive pairs: bench parked
with motors off, flight replays; smallest step 0.075 mm / 1.5e-5 per quaternion component), so on
the robot no motion evidence is required (~frozen_require_motion false). SITL repeats the pose exactly
while parked; planner/sim/bridge_params.yaml sets ~frozen_require_motion true (the FC IMU gyro must
turn at ~frozen_gyro_min 0.2 rad/s during the repeats).
Language: the node is still Python (the live one); this is a minimal change to it. A C++ port is a
separate task (owner rule: robot software in C++).
Deploy (owner): apply to overrides/FAST-LIO/src/, scripts/apply_overrides.sh apply, restart the
bridge node on the robot (bind-mount note: restart the container). Not done here.

Apply: git apply overrides/FAST-LIO/proposed/fastlio_mavros_bridge_frozen_pose.diff

